<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Google Account Linked</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6;">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h2 style="color: #2563eb;">Google Account Linked Successfully</h2>
    <p>Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
    <p>We noticed that you logged in using Google for the first time. Your Google account has been successfully linked to your existing credential-based account on the <strong>DIU Smart Hall System</strong>.</p>
    <p>You can now log in using either your password or your Google account seamlessly.</p>
    <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 20px;">If you did not perform this action, please secure your account immediately.</p>
    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 20px 0;">
    <p style="font-size: 0.85em; color: #94a3b8;">DIU Smart Hall Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>